"{\"title\":\"Terraria Overhaul (Configuration Update!)\",\"desc\":\"\\n\\nA large mod for Terraria that focuses on increasing overall enjoyment of the game, via improving aspects such as: combat looks, feel, & mechanics, movement, camera, ambience, and even the entire soundtrack.\\n\\nThe Work-in-Progress 5.0 version for Terraria 1.4 is a complete reimplementation of the mod, which boasts:\\n- A vastly superior & open sourced codebase;\\n- Reimagined and more vanilla-faithful, while also more crazy, solid and fun game design;\\n- Magnitudes more overall quality assurance & polishing.\\n- Near flawless compatibility with content mods, to be polished further soon.\\n\\n\\nF.A.Q.\\nHow do I configure the mod?\\nJust click 'Configuration' in the top left corner of main menu!\\nWhy are some features missing?\\nPlease read the description above!\\n\\n\\nLinks\\n- Chat and ask questions on our Discord Server 💬[discord.gg]\\n- Show your support on Patreon ❤️[patreon.com]\\n- See update posts on mirsar.io 👁️[mirsar.io]\\n- Check out our brand new Wiki 📝[mirsar.io]\\n- Contribute on GitHub ⚙️[github.com]\\n\\n\\nContributing\\nTerraria Overhaul is openly developed on GitHub, and all contributions are welcome and appreciated! If you happen to be either:\\n- On familiar terms with C# programming;\\n- A great pixel artist;\\n- Multilingual, with a supported language as your first;\\n- Or have just found bugs to report;\\nThen please, consider heading over to our GitHub repository's issues and helping out![github.com]\\n\\n\\nRecommended Mods\\n- High FPS Support\\n- WeaponOut Lite: An Item Holding Mod (FK99's Official Remake)\",\"stats\":\"67.177 MB | 23 May, 2022 @ 6:06pm | 1 Apr, 2024 @ 12:18am\",\"tags\":\"\"}"
